<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Australia 2020 indexed bond yields 4.136 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Australia 2020 indexed bond yields 4.136 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of today's A$100 million indexed Treasury bond tender, announced by Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA):</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  4.0 Aug 2020 AS100 million    A$102.100 million 4.136	 4.10-4.14</p>
<p>(RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 50)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
